\id EZR  
\h 'Etsitɨraxi 
\toc1 'Etsitɨraxi 
\toc2 'Etsitɨraxi 
\toc3 'Ets 
\mt1 'Etsitɨraxi  
\c 1  
\s1 Tsiru kemɨtiuta'aitaxɨ  
\p
\v 1 Merikɨtsɨ mexɨakame wiyaritsie ti'aitakaku Tsiru, Peritsiya kwieyaritsie ti'aitame, Yawé ti'aitame 'iyarieya mɨpaɨ katiniuyuitɨani, mɨkɨ ti'aitame minetɨanikɨ 'aitsika naitsarie mitanɨ'axɨanikɨ mɨra'aitatsie, hikɨ mɨpaɨ mɨraye'atɨarienikɨ Yawé niukieya Keremiyaxi kemɨtiupitɨa. Ti'aitame mɨpaɨ 'aneme 'aitsika kaniutawewieni, meta yakaniutayɨni yuniukikɨ meta mɨpaɨ katinaka'utsieni:   
\pmo
\v 2 «'Ipaɨ paine Tsiru, Peritsiya kwieyaritsie ti'aitame:  
\pm »Yawé, Kakaɨyari taheima makawe, hikɨ 'ena kwiepa yunaime te'aitamete mɨnetsiyetuiri, kaneniuhɨritɨani nemitawewienikɨ tuki Kerutsareme kiekariyaritsie, Kura kwieyaritsie.  
\v 3 Hikɨ 'ayumieme, kemɨ'ane Kura mɨkiekame, Kerutsareme keheyani Yawé tukieya metawewienikɨ, 'Ixaheri Kakaɨyarieya, mɨkɨ Kakaɨyari Kerutsareme muyeika, merikɨte mɨkɨ Kakaɨyari kewareparewieka nekanaineni.  
\v 4 Meta mɨpaɨ nepɨra'aita yunaitɨ kiekatari naitsarie kiekaritetsie hakewa meme'uwa huriyutsixi memɨyuhayewatɨwe xekeniwareparewi xetewakupitɨwatɨ pɨrata meta huru, piinite meta tewaxi, meta kexemɨteyɨwawe xeketeneyetua 'imikieri Kakaɨyari tukieyatsie mieme Kerutsareme kiekariyaritsie metawewiyani».   
\s1 Huriyutsixi kememɨte'akunuaxɨa  
\p
\v 5 Hikɨ Wenikamini nuiwarimama meta Kura nuiwarimama 'ukirawetsixi memanuyetei, yaxeikɨa yunaitɨ mawari wewiwamete meta rewitsixi, yunaitɨ kemɨ'ane Kakaɨyari mɨpaɨ mɨtiwaruyuitɨa wa'iyaritsie memɨyehukɨ tuki tawarita memetawewienikɨ, yamekateniuxata memɨyehukɨ Kerutsareme.  
\v 6 Hikɨ memɨkawateɨterimatɨkai yunaitɨ mekaniwaruparewieni pɨratakɨ meta hurukɨ, piinitekɨ meta tewaxi wahekɨ, piinite mɨraye'atɨkakɨ, meta 'imikierite mekateniwayetuirieni tiwaɨkawame kememɨteyɨwawekai.  
\v 7 Metatsiere, ti'aitame Tsiru, katiniuta'aita mɨrewayetɨkienikɨ piinite Nawukurunutsuxi mɨrewayetɨkai Yawé tukita Kerutsareme, hikɨ mɨkɨ yukakaɨyari tukita pɨta katineutapikaitɨni.  
\v 8 Tsiru katiniyetuani tumini hɨweme Mitɨriratexi hetsɨa, mɨkɨta tiuti'inɨataka, katiniyetuani Tsetsiwatsaxi hetsɨa Kura kwieyaritsie memakunuaxɨanikekai wa'ukiyari.   
\p
\v 9 Mɨkɨ piinite mɨtiyetuiya mɨpaɨ katinipaɨmekaitɨni:  
\b  
\tr
\tc1 watsute 'amɨnene hurukɨ mɨwewiyatɨka
\tc2 30 
\tr
\tc1 watsute 'amɨnene pɨratakɨ mɨwewiyatɨka
\tc2 1.000 
\tr
\tc1 nawaxate
\tc2 29 
\tr
\tc1   
\v 10 watsute yakɨ mɨnenekai hurukɨ mɨwewiyatɨka
\tc2 30 
\tr
\tc1 watsute yakɨ mɨnenekai pɨratakɨ mɨwewiyatɨka
\tc2 410 
\tr
\tc1 meta yɨkɨ ti'anenetɨ hipatɨ
\tc2 1.000  
\b  
\p
\v 11 Mɨkɨ tiyunɨtɨ hurukɨ pɨratakɨ mɨtiwewiyatɨka pɨtipaɨmekai: 'auxɨwime miriyari heimana nauka tsienituyari (5.400) piinite. Naime 'ikɨ piinite Tsetsiwatsaxi katinetɨni Kerutsareme paitɨ kepauka Wawiruniya memehapaniekaitsie memupitɨarietsie Kerutsareme memakunuaxɨanikɨ.   
\c 2  
\s1 Kememɨte'aka'uxa keyupaɨmetɨ memakunuaxɨa  
\p
\v 1 'Ikɨ 'ena mepaye'uxa teɨteri Kura kwieyaritsie memɨkiekataritɨkai Nawukurunutsuxi, Wawiruniyatsie ti'aitame, muwarehapa Wawiruniya paitɨ, meta kemɨ'ane memupitɨarie Kerutsareme meta Kura kwieyaritsie hutarieka memɨ'axɨanikɨ. Yuxexɨitɨ mɨkɨ mekaniu'axɨani yukiekaritsie,  
\v 2 mewaraweiyatɨ Tsuruwaweri, Ketsuha, Nehemiyaxi, Tserahiyaxi, Xerahiyaxi, Maxirukeyu, Wiritsani, Mitsipaxi, Wihiwahi, Xekuni meta Wanaha.  
\b  
\p 'Ikɨ 'ixaheritsixi kaniwaxapayaritɨni kemeyupaɨmetɨ memakunuaxɨa:   
\b  
